      "body": "<p>感谢提交 Pull Requests ！此PR未通过DCO校验。<br>校验失败可能原因：</br><br>1. 未签署“DCO协议”（开发者原创声明协议），<a href=\"https://dco.openharmony.cn/sign/Z2l0ZWUlMkZvcGVuX2hhcm1vbnk=\">在线签署、查看签署状态</a>。</br><br>2. Commits 中未包含 Signed-off-by信息，<a href=\"https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/contribute/FAQ.md\">参考FAQ处理</a>。</br><br>修复上述问题后，在PR的评论框输入“check dco” ，单击”评论”，系统将再次进行DCO校验。</br><br>当前检测到如下Commits的Signed-off-by邮箱未签署DCO协议：</br><ul><li><a href=\"https://gitcode.com/openharmony/third_party_jsframework/commits/detail/a280a42fe7f73d59528ecbde04f319cc61e5de0b?ref=master&prId=853\">a280a42</a></li></ul><hr></hr><p>Thanks for submitting a pull request. This pull request has not passed the DCO check.<br>Possible causes:</br><br>1. You have not signed the Developer Certificate of Origin (DCO). <a href=\"https://dco.openharmony.cn/sign/Z2l0ZWUlMkZvcGVuX2hhcm1vbnk=\">Sign the DCO and check DCO status</a>.</br><br>2. The commits do not contain the Signed-off-by information. To resolve this issue, <a href=\"https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/en/contribute/faqs.md\">see FAQs</a>.</br><br>After resolving the preceding issues, enter check dco in the comment box of this pull request and click Comment. The system will check DCO status again.</br><br>The Signed-off-by emails in the following commits have not signed the DCO:</br><ul><li><a href=\"https://gitcode.com/openharmony/third_party_jsframework/commits/detail/a280a42fe7f73d59528ecbde04f319cc61e5de0b?ref=master&prId=853\">a280a42</a></li></ul>",
